 ⟩\\n+      (b ⁻¹ ∙ b) ∙ a ≈⟨ assoc (b ⁻¹) b a ⟩\\n+      b ⁻¹ ∙ (b ∙ a) ≈⟨ ∙-cong refl (sym recover) ⟩\\n+      b ⁻¹ ∙ (x ∙ b) ≈⟨ ∙-cong refl (∙-cong p refl) ⟩\\n+      b ⁻¹ ∙ (ε ∙ b) ≈⟨ ∙-cong refl (identityˡ b) ⟩\\n+      b ⁻¹ ∙ b ≈⟨ inverseˡ b ⟩\\n+      ε ∎)\\n+      where\\n+      recover : x ∙ b ≈ b ∙ a\\n+      recover = begin\\n+        x ∙ b ≈⟨ assoc (b ∙ a) (b ⁻¹) b ⟩\\n+        (b ∙ a) ∙ (b ⁻¹ ∙ b) ≈⟨ ∙-cong refl (inverseˡ b) ⟩\\n+        (b ∙ a) ∙ ε ≈⟨ identityʳ (b ∙ a) ⟩\\n+        b ∙ a ∎\\n+\\n+    conclude : x ≈ ε ⊎ x ≈ a → x ≈ a\\n+    conclude (inj₁ p) = ⊥-elim (nontrivial p)\\n+    conclude (inj₂ p) = p\\n*** End Patch\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a13816-b02c-79c3-a7a4-091df754a83e","create_time":1791942400.9297075}}}
